.venv/
.cache/
# Corpus and samples stay local: four of the sample files exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard
# per-file limit, the set is 4.3 GB against a 1.4 MB repo, and republishing FineWeb and
# Wikipedia text carries share-alike and Common Crawl obligations that reading it does not.
# The sample is reproducible from the pinned revisions, the frozen selection salt, and the
# committed manifest, so the recipe is the artifact.
data/*
# The trained tokenizer is small and IS a deliverable, so it is tracked.
!data/tokenizer_final/
data/tokenizer_final/*
!data/tokenizer_final/tokenizer.json
checkpoints/
runs/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
*.pyc
.kiro/
tmp_*.log